      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Editorial note in parentheses: the nine lines that follow were written in red ink. The scan is greyscale and the reprint sets the addendum in the same black type as the rest, so the red lines cannot be told apart by colour, and this note is what identifies them. What follows to its left is a supplementary list of councillors with the months of their appointment."
